@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Behavior - Measure proposed concurrent API workload
actor "Release operator" as actor
box "Release tooling - backend/src/MissionControl.Operations" #E0F2FE
  participant "OperationsConsole" as console
  participant "MeasureApiLoadOperation" as load
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Api (performance instance)" #D1FADF
  participant "RequestTimingMiddleware" as timing
  participant "Existing feature endpoints" as api
  participant "Restricted timing records" as records
end box
box "Selected SQL provider" #FFF4E5
  database "Isolated SQL target\n(scenario fixture)" as db
end box
box "Release records - docs/operations/performance" #ECFDF3
  participant "PerformanceResult" as result
end box
actor -> console : load (EnvironmentManifest; LoadScenario; fixture restored; request timing enabled)
console -> load : Run with bound PerformanceOptions
load -> timing : GET /health/ready; list totals for leads, workspaces, work items
timing -> api : Pipeline
api -> db : Parameterized reads
db --> api : Counts
api --> load : Readiness and total counts
break Readiness 503 or totals differ from 1,000 leads (including the seeded City contact) / 50 workspaces / 10,000 work items
  load --> console : Not started: fixture not ready
  console -> result : Outcome NotRun; no latency recorded
  console --> actor : Restore the fixture into an empty target and restart the API
end
load -> timing : POST /api/sessions for 5 Administrator and 20 Collaborator accounts
timing -> api : Pipeline
api --> load : Access tokens
break Any 401 or 429
  load --> console : Not started: session sign-in failed
  console -> result : Outcome NotRun
  console --> actor : Check session accounts, secrets, and throttling
end
loop 1 minute warm-up, then 10 measured minutes: open-loop schedule, 25 sessions x 1 request/s
  load -> timing : Scheduled request from the mix (60% reads / 40% permitted writes); never delayed by a slow response
  note over load, api
  Every write is valid when sent, so Baseline expects only each class's success status:
  lead edits keep email and category; work edits leave status unchanged (never a story Done);
  card moves go between To Do and In Progress, or to Done only with no unfinished tasks;
  sprint planning saves the owned planned sprint (SaveSprintPlanCommand),
  alternately adding and removing one pool story.
  end note
  opt LargeHotWorkspace
    note over load, api
    Ordinary writes stay in each session's own workspaces.
    Backlog, board-batch, and sprint-history reads target the hot workspace.
    Every 30 s one Collaborator session adds a long-distance reorder:
    last backlog story to the top, then back on the next turn.
    Expects 200; 409 / 503 reported as rejections.
    end note
  end
  timing -> api : Authenticated pipeline; thin controller; MediatR handler
  api -> db : Parameterized reads / workspace lock first, then versioned writes
  db --> api : Rows / commit
  api --> timing : Response written
  timing --> load : Status, X-Correlation-ID, diagnostic Server-Timing (time to headers)
  timing -> records : On response completed: RequestTimingRecord (server ms, lock wait, SQL commands)
  load -> load : Log scheduled and sent times, status, bytes, correlation ID; no retry
end
opt LargeHotWorkspace: after the measured window, every scheduled request (card moves included) stopped
  load -> timing : Read every page of the hot sprint's closure review
  timing -> api : Pipeline
  api -> db : Parameterized reads
  db --> api : Unfinished stories, total, planned destination, reviewed revision
  api --> load : 200 review pages
  load -> timing : Close the hot sprint: reviewed revision; every returned unfinished story carried to the planned sprint
  timing -> api : Pipeline; workspace lock first
  alt Lock acquired and reviewed revision current
    api -> db : Close, carry stories, record history and audit in one transaction
    db --> api : Commit
    api --> load : 200 closed sprint
  else Reviewed revision stale (409) or lock wait timed out (503)
    api --> load : 409 or 503; no partial change
    load -> load : Count as a reported rejection; no retry
  end
  timing -> records : On response completed: RequestTimingRecord per review page and close
end
load -> records : Read JSON timing lines from the configured diagnostics location
records --> load : Lines parsed by field name into TimingRecordEntry values (Operations-local; no Api type)
load -> load : Discard warm-up; join by correlation ID; classify each response once:\nsuccess / expected rejection / unexpected 4xx-5xx / transport error / missing timing record
load -> timing : Post-load invariant reads: paged work items, backlog, boards, sprints, history, acknowledged writes
timing -> api : Pipeline
api -> db : Parameterized reads
db --> api : Rows and total counts
api --> load : Pages with total counts
load -> load : L2-046.3 identity, typed parents, order, at most one active sprint, one open sprint per story,\nearlier closed history unchanged, acknowledged writes stored, carried stories in the planned sprint
load --> console : Per class: offered/completed, success p95, rejection p95, lock wait / execution p95, counts
console -> result : Scenario, classes, rates, nearest-rank p95, Stopwatch clock, invariants, manifest, outcome
alt SharedWorkspaceContention or LargeHotWorkspace
  alt Unexpected status, transport error, missing timing record, or invariant failure
    console --> actor : Outcome Failed for this scenario; causes named
  else Otherwise
    console --> actor : Outcome Reported: conflicts, lock timeouts, lock wait vs execution, heavy samples; no L2-046 claim
  end
else Baseline: unexpected status, transport error, missing timing record, schedule lag, or invariant failure
  console --> actor : Outcome Failed; failing classes or rules named; no passing claim
else Baseline: any class below 500 successful samples or successful p95 > 500 ms
  console --> actor : Outcome Failed; workload not executed as specified or budget missed
else Baseline: manifest differs from the L2-046 profile
  console --> actor : Outcome OtherEnvironment; recorded separately, never labeled passing
else Baseline: every class within budget on the stated profile
  console --> actor : Outcome Passed for this run; L2-046.1 proposed budget met
end
@enduml
